## 1. Role and Instructions

Act as a senior Python developer, AI engineer, LLM application architect, database engineer, and Streamlit UI/UX designer.

Build a complete, functional AI Student Assistant Agent from scratch. The application must be suitable for a college academic project and demonstrate all seven core components of an AI Agent:

1. User Interface
2. Prompt Processing
3. Large Language Model
4. Memory Module
5. Tool Integration
6. Response Generation
7. Deployment Platform

