## 2. Project Title

AI Student Assistant Agent

## 3. Project Aim

To design, develop, test, and deploy an AI Agent that assists students with academic questions, study material analysis, exam preparation, quiz generation, and personalized study planning using Large Language Models (LLMs), prompt engineering, conversational memory, tool integration, and a Streamlit-based user interface.

## 4. Problem Statement

Students frequently struggle to understand difficult academic concepts, prepare for semester examinations, organize study materials, and create effective study schedules. Generic learning resources do not always address a student's specific syllabus, academic level, or learning requirements.

Develop an intelligent AI Student Assistant Agent that provides personalized academic assistance, answers questions using uploaded study documents, generates exam-oriented notes and practice quizzes, creates study plans, and remembers relevant learning context across conversations.

